\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces EVIDENCE, whole, with its head: the plan's bullet ASKS, PROBE raises the card (consumer/, executor/, proof/, and one id per value), and the three lanes run through MAKE and BIND at the same time. The value lane fills the card itself; a DATA display freezes its intake from the card's proof/; the citation lane is a person's and does not pass through the card. Two ticks revert; accepted is CHECK's. Neither stage writes a sentence; REVISE does, quoting one value by its id.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
